From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: knapcio <knapcio@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 19:47:47 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 16/39] S2: DFlash2 drafter step under the MTP first form on
 its own stream behind G6_DRAFT_PAR=1|2

A solo DFlash2 round makes the drafter choice before the first form (it reads nothing the first form writes),
launches the drafter step on its own stream, runs the first form (and the chain on MTP rounds), then waits.
Same graphs, inputs and fabrics: each step's bytes are as serial. 2: drafting steps on a high-priority stream.
G6_S2_ROUNDLOG adds a '# s2_dfl' line: the drafter step's launch-to-wait ms.
batch_draftpar_test: serial and parallel batches give the same tokens, requests, steps and stats.
